# Controls what `wrangler deploy` uploads as static assets — separate from .gitignore,
# and NOT automatically respected by the asset-upload step (confirmed: .git and .claude
# were uploaded on the first deploy despite being in .gitignore). Everything here must stay
# out of the publicly-served site: full git internals, internal dev docs, and tooling files.
.git
.claude
.wrangler
node_modules
wrangler.jsonc
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.dev.vars*
.env*
README.md
CHANGELOG.md
VERSIONING.md
DEPLOYMENT.md
SECURITY.md
TODO.md
requests/
